          ],
          "description": "Cognito identity pool admits anonymous AWS credentials AND its unauthenticated role carries S3 actions AND the action target is an S3 bucket tagged data-classification=phi. The compound describes an internet-to-PHI data path that no individual control catches: UNAUTH.S3 alone fires on any S3 access (over-broad signal); the PHI marker alone is the desired state. Their conjunction over a shared bucket ARN — surfaced via scope_field on the bucket's identity — is the HIPAA-reportable shape.\n"
